Hello,

I apologize for the unconventional outreach, it's for a good purpose.
My name is Jacquelyn Mitchard, I am a banker.I write to you
to repatriate unclaimed account balance, left by deceased customer
who happens to have the same surname as you.

For years, the account went unclaimed because the deceased died with his
family in a car crash. All efforts the bank made to locate the deceased
family through the embassy were unsuccessful, now the account is
considered unclaimed and could be seized and freeze.

So I contact you to make this deal with you because it will be very
easy for bank to pay you the money as the deceased next of kin
hence you have the same last name as him.

Please reply if you would like to know more.

Thanks
Jacquelyn


